    "long_instructions": "### Use AI like an Illustrator\r\n\r\n1. Think about the audience of your guide and an image they may want.\r\n   \r\n2. Type a detailed prompt into the chat.\r\n\r\n4. Try different prompts & compare results. \r\n\r\n5. Save an image you like to the backpack for your project. \r\n\r\n>**Use your prompting strategy:** Include a goal, context, and details.\r\n>\r\n>*For example:* `A portrait of a young, female player with a red and black jersey for a special article in the school newspaper.`",
